# cell/lane glob	reason
*-cjs-split*	refused (the entry requires its chunk by a relative path and writes exports), and a refused multi-input run writes deobfuscated.<name>.js, which the chunk require cannot find
*-split*/default	the default lane keeps a bundle with a relative import whole, and a multi-input run that unpacks nothing writes deobfuscated.<name>.js, which the entry's chunk import cannot find
*-split*/split	the default lane keeps a bundle with a relative import whole, and a multi-input run that unpacks nothing writes deobfuscated.<name>.js, which the entry's chunk import cannot find
